<title>USA: CBOT ammonia/DAP deliveries - Aug 30.</title>
<headline>CBOT ammonia/DAP deliveries - Aug 30.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delivery notices against September futures for September 3 (in contracts) --</p>
<p>Anhydrous Ammonia - 6. Oldest long - June 7, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - refco/c 5, 1st option/c 1.</p>
<p>Received - cargill investor services/c 6.</p>
<p>Diammonium Phosphate - 12. Oldest long - May 29, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - merrill lynch/c 12.</p>
<p>Received - cargill investor services/h 7, merrill lynch/c 5.</p>
<p>Source: Chicago Board of Trade Clearing Corp.</p>
<p>H=House account. C=Customer Account.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
